'''Journey to Talent''' is the only stage in [[Valkyrie Cat's Trial]]. After clearing this [[No Continues]] stage, Valkyrie Cat's Trial disappears permanently and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]]'s [[Talents]] can be unlocked.

